     2888          and buf_ext-classif.classif-subject = 'clients':U
     2889          and buf_ext-classif.classif-name    = 'clients-edoc-nn':U
     2890          no-error.
     2891   if available buf_ext-classif then do :
     2892     return yes .
     2893   end.
     2894   return no.
     2895   END FUNCTION.
     2896   FUNCTION status-is-edi RETURN logical ( input p-is-edi as logical
     2897                                            , input p-cli-type as character
